Build 99 STOP repair. P1 "プレーヤーを選択" can wrap while P2 "対戦相手を選択" does not (font dependent: cloud ja 380-385pt, Mac 390pt), which broke the approved left/right card alignment (191 vs 176pt). match-setup-ux-v1.js measures the real line count and sets a class; match-setup-ux-v1.css equalises the name boxes. Approved D2 sizes and 390pt layout untouched. New Node + real-Chrome tests (negative control fails on unfixed main); change map records that no existing test changed.

